			"Message": "refactor(Mist): Update to hickory-server 0.26 API\n\nMigrate from hickory-server 0.25 to 0.26, which reorganized its module structure:\n- `authority::*` → `zone_handler::*`\n- `InMemoryAuthority` → `InMemoryZoneHandler<T>` (now generic over RuntimeProvider)\n- `ServerFuture` → `Server`\n- AXFR bool parameter → `AxfrPolicy` enum (using `AxfrPolicy::Deny`)\n\nPinned all handlers to `TokioRuntimeProvider` for concrete return types. Added `DNS_TCP_RESPONSE_BUFFER_SIZE` constant (65,535 bytes) for TCP listener registration. Updated test import from `Authority` trait to `ZoneHandler`.\n\nThe DNS server behavior remains unchanged; only module paths and types updated to match the new Hickory API.",
			"SHA": "160d79e01b257bd6cdbfcf256f822121ca1260ca"
		}
